      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Here is my thinking. Droopy eyelid, double vision and weakness that all get worse with tiredness is a pattern I take seriously. I can't rule out a condition where nerves and muscles don't communicate properly, called myasthenia.",
